{
    "title": "Acertijo Mental: Brain Games",
    "description": "Are you a fan of riddles? Brain Teaser is the perfect word puzzle game for you! Exercise your brain with thousands of riddles! Ranging from fun to silly, easy to extremely difficult, these clever word riddles are sure to entertain you for hours. You can learn new words and strengthen your knowledge through word games.\r\n\r\n<b>How to play:</b>\r\n\u2022Read the riddles and guess the answer.\r\n\u2022Spell the hidden words by placing the letters on the blocks in the correct order.\r\n\u2022At first they are simple puzzles, but with increasing level the difficulty will increase.\r\n\u2022 4 types of hints will help you solve complex puzzles: remove all the uncertain letters in the blocks, reveal a random letter, reveal a letter from a specific block, and reveal at least 3 letters.\r\n\u2022The clues will help you solve the word puzzles.\r\n\r\n<b>Brain Puzzle Features:</b>\r\n\u2605Tons of difficult puzzles to solve.\r\n\u2605Use the clues to find the answer in a difficult situation.\r\n\u2605Increasing difficulty throughout the levels of riddles and puzzles.\r\n\u2605Difficult, challenging and fun word levels.\r\n\u2605You can unlock achievements as you progress through the brain games.\r\n\u2605Get new free hints every day to solve puzzles with answer.\r\n\u2605Easy to play but hard to beat free riddles and brain teaser challenges.\r\n\u2605No network required: Enjoy yourself in the world of riddles and brain teasers!\r\n\r\nDownload Brain Teaser to train your brain for free, and try your best to unlock all levels of the word game. Guess the words and have fun! Challenging word puzzles will brighten your day!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you a fan of riddles? Brain Teaser is the perfect word puzzle game for you! Exercise your brain with thousands of riddles! Ranging from fun to silly, easy to extremely difficult, these clever word riddles are sure to entertain you for hours. You can learn new words and strengthen your knowledge through word games.<br><br><b>How to play:</b><br>\u2022Read the riddles and guess the answer.<br>\u2022Spell the hidden words by placing the letters on the blocks in the correct order.<br>\u2022At first they are simple puzzles, but with increasing level the difficulty will increase.<br>\u2022 4 types of hints will help you solve complex puzzles: remove all the uncertain letters in the blocks, reveal a random letter, reveal a letter from a specific block, and reveal at least 3 letters.<br>\u2022The clues will help you solve the word puzzles.<br><br><b>Brain Puzzle Features:</b><br>\u2605Tons of difficult puzzles to solve.<br>\u2605Use the clues to find the answer in a difficult situation.<br>\u2605Increasing difficulty throughout the levels of riddles and puzzles.<br>\u2605Difficult, challenging and fun word levels.<br>\u2605You can unlock achievements as you progress through the brain games.<br>\u2605Get new free hints every day to solve puzzles with answer.<br>\u2605Easy to play but hard to beat free riddles and brain teaser challenges.<br>\u2605No network required: Enjoy yourself in the world of riddles and brain teasers!<br><br>Download Brain Teaser to train your brain for free, and try your best to unlock all levels of the word game. Guess the words and have fun! Challenging word puzzles will brighten your day!",
